| `shell.linter` | string | `shellcheck` | an adapter name `scripts/shell_gate.py` has: `shellcheck` | `scripts/shell_gate.py`, through `scripts/config_loader.py`'s `shell.linter` row | Names the linter `make lint-sh` runs; its status is the target's. A name with no adapter is exit 14 before anything runs; the tool on neither the interpreter's directory nor PATH is exit 11 naming it. Absent, the targets write `[using default] shell.linter = "shellcheck"` to stderr. | formatting: `shell.formatter` | always |
